    "title": "Add ARRAY_REVERSE supported in SQL & Table API",
    "description": "array_reverse(array) - Returns an array in reverse order.\r\n\r\nSyntax:\r\narray_reverse(array)\r\n\r\nArguments:\r\narray: An ARRAY to be handled.\r\n\r\nReturns:\r\n\r\nReturns an array in reverse order.\r\n\r\nReturns null if the argument is null\r\n{code:sql}\r\n> SELECT array_reverse(array(1, 2, 2, NULL));\r\n NULL, 2, 2, 1{code}\r\nSee also\r\nbigquery [https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/reference/standard-sql/functions-and-operators#array_reverse]",
